{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/e93b91a8a67da9ac6d6a395d9d9a807e.poster.avif?t=1773152474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/e93b91a8a67da9ac6d6a395d9d9a807e.webm?t=1773152474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Villa Nocturne blends classic horror elements with a modern narrative to deliver a tense survival experience. Players step into a dark mansion filled with mysterious notes, haunting sounds, and supernatural entities, where every corner hides a secret waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shadowy corridors, follow cryptic clues, unlock hidden rooms, and face the terrors that escalate with every step. With atmospheric lighting, detailed environment design, and immersive soundscapes, Villa Nocturne draws players into the heart of a chilling nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a story of survival\u2014it is a journey through layers of secrets hidden in every detail. As you progress, you will confront not only the ghosts of the past but also your own fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/5f8ed25db27dd96e3a395750f9a8e4eb.poster.avif?t=1773152474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/5f8ed25db27dd96e3a395750f9a8e4eb.webm?t=1773152474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAtmospheric survival experience: Wander through dark hallways, hold your breath when the lights go out, and face the lurking horrors in the shadows.<br>\u30fbPuzzles and exploration: Collect clues across the mansion, unlock forbidden areas, and come closer to uncovering the truth.<br>\u30fbIntense suspense and terror: Sudden doors slamming, unexpected jumpscares, and scenes that play with the player\u2019s psychology.<br>\u30fbDeep storytelling: Piece together fragments of a dark past, but only those who endure to the end will discover the final truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villa Nocturne is not only horror\u2014it is a story of regret, loss, and confronting the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/0408e4e6d9fc56713fc8f04a50e2c20b.poster.avif?t=1773152474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/0408e4e6d9fc56713fc8f04a50e2c20b.webm?t=1773152474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955080?t=1773152474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955080?t=1773152474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/4244bbb293847a5c4488fa8deed3c8e4c2dfe55f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773152474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/4244bbb293847a5c4488fa8deed3c8e4c2dfe55f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773152474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of blood and violence, depictions of corpses, accidental deaths, and injuries. The dark and oppressive atmosphere includes horror elements and jumpscares that may be disturbing to some players. Certain scenes also imply the use of alcohol or tobacco."},"demos":[{"appid":4129840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/e93b91a8a67da9ac6d6a395d9d9a807e.poster.avif?t=1773152474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/e93b91a8a67da9ac6d6a395d9d9a807e.webm?t=1773152474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Villa Nocturne blends classic horror elements with a modern narrative to deliver a tense survival experience. Players step into a dark mansion filled with mysterious notes, haunting sounds, and supernatural entities, where every corner hides a secret waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shadowy corridors, follow cryptic clues, unlock hidden rooms, and face the terrors that escalate with every step. With atmospheric lighting, detailed environment design, and immersive soundscapes, Villa Nocturne draws players into the heart of a chilling nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a story of survival\u2014it is a journey through layers of secrets hidden in every detail. As you progress, you will confront not only the ghosts of the past but also your own fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955080/extras/5f8ed25db27dd96e3a395750f9a8e4eb.poster.avif?t=1773152474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor